  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GPI: Procurement Assistance for Philippines: Phase III Procurement Advisors, through Nathan Associates Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance grant provides funding for a Procurement Advisor with two Sector Procurement Experts (Advisors) to assist the Philippines Department of Transportation (DOTr). The grant represents Phase III of the Procurement Assistance Program for the Philippines under the Global Procurement Initiative: Understanding Best Value (GPI). The Advisors provide strategic and technical procurement advice on transportation sector procurements, with the goal of incorporating value-based methodologies into DOTr&apos;s procurement process. A value-based procurement system will help implement sustainable, high-quality transportation projects and may increase opportunities for U.S. companies to bid on and potentially win transportation tenders.</narrative>
  </description>
